              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' sleémeero awa Yeroboamu aa tleéhh, nee slaqwaradá' aa slaáqw ar migi nee adoodá' Damasko nee Hamati ngira hayóh tari yaamaá Israeli, tlehhmi'iiká' sleémeero kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú qom'aá waawituú Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
